\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid15275290 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  "advertises" the use of the UIDPLUS extension in its response to the IMAP Capability command.  No }{\insrsid15275290 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  set-up or configuration is required.  UIDPLUS will only be utilized if the Mail Client (MUA) supports this IMAP extension. There are no }{\insrsid15275290 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  user interface changes for UIDPLUS support. IMAP UIDPLUS extension is defined in RFC 2359}{\b\insrsid7218531 
