\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 You can create a }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 sales}{\insrsid7218531  mailbox for prospects to use when inquiring about your products and prices.  Set the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Forward To}{\insrsid7218531  field in the Properties form to forward all incoming mail messages to the employee in your company that deals with these inquiries.  You have the option of discarding the original message after it has been forwarded, or selecting to deliver the message to the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 sales}{\insrsid7218531  mailbox.
\par }\pard\plain \s2\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb120\sa40\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f1\fs28\cf17\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 #{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 #}{\insrsid15606814  MailboxQuotas}}K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Mailbox Quotas}}}{\insrsid7218531  Mailbox Quotas
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Quotas}}}{\insrsid15275290 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  provides support for Mailbox Quotas, which allow you to limit the size to which a mailbox can grow.  This is particularly useful for IMAP mailboxes, where the messages typically remain on the server.
\par Mailbox Quotas can be set at three different levels: for the whole server, for all users in a domain, or for a specific mailbox.  Each quota setting has two levels: }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Quota Level}{\insrsid7218531  and }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Warning Level}{\insrsid7218531 .  When the size of a mailbox reaches the Warning Level, the user (and optionally the postmaster) receives a warning message from the system.  When the size of a mailbox reaches the Quota Level, all new messages addressed to the user are rejected.  Delivery of new messages to the mailbox will resume once the user deletes some messages from his mailbox.
\par Refer to the section on }{\uldb\insrsid7218531 Quotas}{\v\uldb\insrsid7218531 QuotasPage}{\insrsid7218531  for more information.
{\v0\par\v}}\pard\plain \s2\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb120\sa40\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f1\fs28\cf17\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 #{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 #}{\insrsid15606814  WebMailboxAdministration}}K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Web Mailbox Administration}}}{\insrsid7218531  Web Mailbox Administration
