\par }{\insrsid7218531 Enter your e-mail address and password.  Your e-mail address consists of the name of your mailbox, the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 @}{\insrsid7218531  character, and the name of your mail domain.  If your mailbox is in the default domain, then you can omit your mail domain.
\par Your privilege level determines whether you can administer your own mailbox, other mailboxes in your domain, or mailboxes in all domains.  Your privilege level also determines which mail lists you can administer.  The }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Privilege Level}{\insrsid7218531  is a property of your mailbox and is set in the Mailbox General form.  The choices are }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Server}{\insrsid7218531 , }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Domain}{\insrsid7218531 , or }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 None}{\insrsid7218531 .
\par If your privilege level is }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 None}{\insrsid7218531 , then you will be logged onto your Mailbox Properties form.  You can set all of your mailbox properties using this form (except your privilege level).  You can also administer mail lists that you moderate.
\par If you have }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Domain}{\insrsid7218531  privilege, then you will be able to add, delete and modify mailboxes and mail lists in your own domain.  If you have }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Server}{\insrsid7218531  privilege, then you will be able to add, delete and modify mailboxes and mail lists in all domains.  }{\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid7218531 Refer to the }{\uldb\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid7218531 Web }{\uldb\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid14683656 Management Center}{\uldb\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid7218531  Reference}{\v\uldb\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid7218531 WebConsoleReference}{\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof\insrsid7218531  section for more information.}{\insrsid7218531 
