\par Note that if a mailbox has the same name as a mail list, messages will be sent to the mailbox and not to the mail list.  Refer to the section on }{\uldb\insrsid7218531 Delivery Precedence}{\v\uldb\insrsid7218531 DeliveryPrecedence}{\insrsid7218531  for more information.
{\v0\par\v}}{\insrsid15275290 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  will }{\i\insrsid7218531 explode}{\insrsid7218531  messages delivered to the mail lists by sending them onward to all list members. It handles messages delivered to }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 -request}{\insrsid7218531  directories by parsing them for commands and creating a }{\i\insrsid7218531 journal}{\insrsid7218531  file that it then returns to the sender.
