\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-720\li115\tx115 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls26\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls26\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\insrsid7218531 If the DNS reverse lookup failed, and the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Accept unknown hosts}{\insrsid7218531  flag is not set, the spam policy is }{\b\insrsid7218531 RejectAllMail.}{\insrsid7218531 
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-720\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls26\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls26\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\insrsid7218531 Otherwise, if the blacklist lookup succeeded, the spam policy is }{\b\insrsid7218531 RejectAllMail}{\insrsid7218531 .
