\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Agents}}}{\insrsid7218531 An }{\i\insrsid7218531 agent}{\insrsid7218531  is an external program or command, supplied by you, that manipulates a mail message.  }{\insrsid536461 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  supports the following types of agents:
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-360\li115\tx115 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls29\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls29\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\insrsid7218531 The }{\b\insrsid7218531 Server Agent}{\insrsid7218531  is executed for every incoming message.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-720\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls29\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls29\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\b\insrsid7218531 Mailbox Agents}{\insrsid7218531  are run when a message is delivered to a mailbox.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-720\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls29\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls29\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\b\insrsid7218531 List Agents}{\insrsid7218531  are run when a message is delivered to a mail list.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-720\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls29\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls29\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\b\insrsid7218531 List Processor Agents}{\insrsid7218531  are run when a message is delivered to a list command address.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\fi-720\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'de\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls29\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'de}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls29\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0 {\b\insrsid7218531 Archive Agent}{\insrsid7218531  is a built-in agent which copies all incoming messages to an archive directory.
\par }\pard \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 {\insrsid7218531 An agent must be a command-line program or batch file (not an interactive program requiring keyboard input, nor a Windows program).
\par }\pard\plain \s2\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb120\sa40\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f1\fs28\cf17\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 #{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 #}{\insrsid15606814  ServerAgent}}K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Server Agent}}}{\insrsid7218531  Server Agent
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Server Agent}}}{\insrsid7218531 Every time }{\insrsid536461 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  receives a message, it invokes the Server Agent.  The agent is told the names of two files: the message file itself, and a file containing SMTP }{\i\insrsid7218531 envelope}{\insrsid7218531  information.
\par The message file has extension }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 MSG}{\insrsid7218531 .  The file containing the SMTP envelope information is known as the }{\i\insrsid7218531 recipients file}{\b\i\insrsid7218531 ,}{\insrsid7218531  although it contains more than just recipient information. When it is passed to the incoming mail agent, it will have extension }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 RCO}{\insrsid7218531 \'3b when the agent terminates, }{\insrsid536461 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  will rename the file to its normal }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 RCP}{\insrsid7218531  extension.
\par Server agents are configured through the }{\uldb\insrsid7218531 Agents}{\v\uldb\insrsid7218531 AgentsPage}{\insrsid7218531  dialog in the }{\insrsid536461 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  }{\insrsid14683656 Management Center}{\insrsid7218531 .  Possible uses for Server agents include:
