\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\fi-360\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls156\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'b7}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls156\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0\pararsid15231392 {\insrsid7218531 Allow TLS (default) }{\insrsid7218531 {\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 190 \\f "Symbol" \\s 8}{\fldrslt\f3\fs16\'be}}}{\insrsid7218531  }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  negotiates with the mail client and optionally encrypts messages if the client has SSL/TLS configured.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\fi-360\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls156\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'b7}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls156\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0\pararsid15231392 {\insrsid7218531 Require TLS }{\insrsid7218531 {\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 190 \\f "Symbol" \\s 8}{\fldrslt\f3\fs16\'be}}}{\insrsid7218531  }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  forces messages to be encrypted.
\par }\pard\plain \s35\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\tx360\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 You must also specify how mail will be sent (relayed) by SMTP. The two settings available from the drop-down menu are:
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\fi-360\li115\tx115 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \ql \fi-360\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls157\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'b7}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls157\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0\pararsid15231392 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Disable TLS }{\insrsid7218531 {\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 190 \\f "Symbol" \\s 8}{\fldrslt\f3\fs16\'be}}}{\insrsid7218531  }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  communicates in clear text mode even if the remote server advertises TLS.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\fi-360\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls157\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'b7}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls157\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0\pararsid15231392 {\insrsid7218531 Use TLS if available (default) }{\insrsid7218531 {\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 190 \\f "Symbol" \\s 8}{\fldrslt\f3\fs16\'be}}}{\insrsid7218531  If the remote SMTP server advertises support for TLS it will attempt to use TLS but will send in clear text mode if unable to establish a secure connection.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\fi-360\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls157\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'b7}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls157\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0\pararsid15231392 {\insrsid7218531 Require TLS if supported }{\insrsid7218531 {\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 190 \\f "Symbol" \\s 8}{\fldrslt\f3\fs16\'be}}}{\insrsid7218531  If the remote SMTP server advertises support for TLS but is unable to establish a secure connection then it is treated as a temporary failure and }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  wil attempt to redeliver.  If the remote SMTP server does not advertise support for TLS then }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  will send in clear text mode.
\par {\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\fi-360\li1080\tx1080 \tab}{\*\pntextbsx\pard\plain\f3\fs16\insrsid7218531 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\tx1080\li1080\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\jclisttab{\*\pnbsx \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls157\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang {\pntxtb \'b7}}\tx1080 \aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls157\adjustright\rin130\txn1080\lin1080\itap0\pararsid15231392 {\insrsid7218531 Require TLS }{\insrsid7218531 {\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 190 \\f "Symbol" \\s 8}{\fldrslt\f3\fs16\'be}}}{\insrsid7218531  }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  will only send messages to remote SMTP servers that advertise support for TLS if it is able to establish a secure connection.
