\par For more information, see the section on }{\uldb\insrsid7218531 List Agents}{\v\uldb\insrsid7218531 ListAgents}{\insrsid7218531 .
{\v0\par\v}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f2\fs16\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Disable Mail List
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 This option disables the entire list.  This is useful if you wish to retain the list configuration but wish to hide the list for security purposes.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f2\fs16\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Confirmation Message To Sender
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Check this box to send a confirmation message to the sender.  The confirmation message contains a copy of the message that was delivered to the list.  If the sender is also a member of the list, she will not receive another copy by virtue of her membership.
\par If you do not check this option then no confirmation will be sent.  If the sender is a member of the list, she will receive a copy of her message by virtue of that membership.
\par This option will guarantee that third party out of office auto-responders will not create mail list }{\i\insrsid7218531 loops}{\insrsid7218531 .   By default, this option is checked.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f2\fs16\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Log List Processor Commands
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 If you select this option }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  will log commands that are sent to the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 list-request}{\insrsid7218531  address. It will record the log information in a file called }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 CMDLOG.TXT}{\insrsid7218531 , located in the list-request directory. Note that this file is not cycled and }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  keeps appending to it. Therefore, you should remember to delete the file every so often, to ensure you don't run out of disk space.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f2\fs16\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Disallow Multiple Commands
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 This option is provided to help list users who may be relatively unfamiliar with list processors. Select this option to process only the first command in messages that are sent to the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 list-request}{\insrsid7218531  address. This means that users do not need to disable their e-mail }{\i\insrsid7218531 signature}{\insrsid7218531 , ensuring that any accidental coincidence of signature lines with valid list processor commands is harmless.
\par If you enable multiple commands by turning off this option, all lines (up to the end of the message or to a }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 STOP}{\insrsid7218531  command) are processed.
\par }\pard\plain \s3\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb120\sa40\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0\pararsid8130183 \b\i\f1\fs24\cf17\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 \page }{\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 #{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 #}{\insrsid15606814  ListMessagesPage}}${\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 $}{\insrsid15606814  List Messages Page}}K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  List Messages Page}}+{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 +}{\insrsid15606814  mailsite:0000}}}{\insrsid7218531  List Messages Page }{\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Mail lists,Messages page}}}{\insrsid7218531 
