\par }{\insrsid7218531 You can configure a list to send a custom Welcome message }{\cs98\super\insrsid7218531 K{\footnote \pard\plain \s97\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\cs98\super\insrsid15606814 K}{\insrsid15606814  Mail lists,Welcome message}}}{\insrsid7218531  when someone joins. Similarly, you can send a custom Goodbye message when someone leaves. Someone who sends a }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 HELP}{\insrsid7218531  command to the mailing list processor can also be sent a custom help message. To configure these messages, select the message category from the drop-down list. Type in a short message in the text window.
\par }\pard\plain \s4\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f2\fs16\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Message Category
\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 You can create custom messages that the list processor sends in response to different commands:
