\par }{\insrsid7218531 You can use this page to add, delete and modify mail lists in this domain.
\par To create a mail list, enter a name in the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Name}{\insrsid7218531  field, select the type of mail list to create from the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Maillist type}{\insrsid7218531  list and click the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Add}{\insrsid7218531  button.  A Report Page will be displayed describing the success or failure of the operation.
\par To delete a Mail List, select its name in the list and click on the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Delete}{\insrsid7218531  button.  A Confirm Page will be displayed describing the operation with }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 OK}{\insrsid7218531  and }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Cancel}{\insrsid7218531  links.
\par To modify a mail list, select its name from the list and click the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Edit}{\insrsid7218531  button.  You will be presented with the properties page for this mail list.
\par To moderate a mail list, select its name from the list and click the }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 Moderate}{\insrsid7218531  button.  You will be presented with the Pending page for this mail list.  Refer to the section on List Moderation for more information.
