\par }\pard\plain \s35\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Specifies the name of a target remote machine (preceded by a double backslash), as well as login data for a mailbox on the target server that has }{\insrsid13722995 WorldMail}{\insrsid7218531  server privileges. This option is used in conjunction with any of the other flags to execute the given operation on the remote system. If this is omitted, the local machine is assumed.
