\par }{\insrsid7218531 List the mailboxes in the given domain. If the domain is omitted, the mailboxes in the default domain are listed.  The plugin ID, mailbox name, full name and password separated by tabs are listed.  Because this command reveals mailbox passwords, a security pass must be supplied.  The }{\b\i\f2\insrsid7218531 pass}{\insrsid7218531  must be the password for the postmaster mailbox in the default domain.  Note that the postmaster mailbox must exist and must have a password that does not contain spaces.
