\par }{\insrsid7218531 Change the plugin which is responsible for the mailbox.  The second form allows you to specify the name of a file containing a list of mailbox names, one per line.  The }{\b\f2\insrsid7218531 pluginid}{\insrsid7218531  indicates which plugin the mailbox should be moved to.
