\par }\pard\plain \ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \f1\fs16\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Here is a step-by-step example of how to use the }{\uldb\insrsid7218531 Database Mailbox Plugin}{\v\uldb\insrsid7218531 DatabaseMailboxPlugin}{\insrsid7218531  in Generic mode with a Microsoft Access database.
{\v0\par\v}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \tx115\li115\ri130\sb80\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin130\txn115\lin115\itap0 \b\f2\fs16\ul\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7218531 Install Microsoft Access
